.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt TIME 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm time
.Nd measure utility real time
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl p
.Ar utility
.Op Ar argument ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility runs
.Ar utility
and writes the observed real time in seconds.
The
.Fl p
option selects the portable report form.
Statistics are written to standard error.
.Pp
The real time comes from the monotonic clock; the user and sys values are the
reaped child's counters from
.Fn proc_times .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The exit status of
.Ar utility
is returned; a usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr times 1
